Cell["\<\
A session's handle is not reused, so a verb on a closed session is refused \
rather than answered from a session opened later.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->448336599,ExpressionUUID->"6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "One session is open at a time for each device. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HGSessionOpen"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/HypergraphRewriteEngine/ref/HGSessionOpen", 
    "WolframInstitute/HypergraphRewriteEngine Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"],
 " is refused while another session is open, so a session that is no longer \
needed should be closed."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->970785311,ExpressionUUID->"15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],

